&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meet Yubico&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yubico is a global leader in identity security and creator of the YubiKey, the original hardware-backed passkey. We are publicly traded on Nasdaq Stockholm; our global footprint includes headquarters in Stockholm, Sweden, Silicon Valley, California; and Singapore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Our Mission?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
