&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Battle Friction:&lt;/strong&gt; We constantly look for new ways to simplify our products, our work, and the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspire Higher:&lt;/strong&gt; We think big, champion the open internet, and strive to do the right thing even when it is difficult.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One Team:&lt;/strong&gt; We are open, responsive, and collaborative, overcoming challenges and celebrating our successes together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
